    "description": "Rarely Available, vacant 2-unit property in desirable Richmond District with epic ocean views from all levels is now available! Perfect for owner-occupiers, extended families & investors alike, this charming property is ready for its next owners to enjoy its coastal vibes! Situated east to west, the property basks in natural sunlight all day through! Large 3,000 sqft. lot with huge yard provides options galore for tailoring this property to meet your needs! Both flats feature a similar floor plan, with living & dining rooms facing east, while the two bedrooms face west with ocean views! The kitchens & baths are original yet feature charming 1947 layout & vintage details with natural sunlight from the skylight. Warm, wood floors, double-pane windows, hall / linen closets & charming wood-burning fireplaces, too! 2-car garage features abundant storage space & room to reimagine / develop! Superb location-WalkScore 88-walk to bus stop, Balboa / Geary shops, cafes, movie theater + more! Golden Gate Park just 1.5 blocks away, Ocean Beach 8 blocks away + Legion of Honor Museum & Land's End close by as well! Easy travel to North Bay/Wine Country via Presidio of SF & Golden Gate Park! South Bay is just through GG Park to 19th A This is a rare opportunity to purchase a vacant 2-unit in SF!"
  },
